OL,3,GNEWSA'Fantastic opportunity' to have
OL,4,Apenguin colony as neighbours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from County Down is joining a
OL,7,Fteam being deployed to Antarctica as
OL,8,Fpart of a project to restore an
OL,9,Fhistoric science facility.
OL,11,FCarole McCullough will be based on
OL,12,FGoudier Island, which is about the size
OL,13,Fof a football pitch, for five months
OL,14,Falong with seven other volunteers.
OL,16,FThe facility, which is more than 80
OL,17,Fyears old, needs significant repairs
OL,18,Fdue to its age and environmental
OL,19,Ffactors such as increased rainfall,
OL,20,Fwater flow and snow loading, the UK
OL,21,FAntarctic Heritage Trust (UKAHT) has
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
