OL,3,GNEWSA'Fantastic opportunity' to have
OL,4,Apenguin colony as neighbours
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I usually run every day so I will miss
OL,7,Fthat but I will just open the door and
OL,8,Flook at the beautiful surroundings and
OL,9,Four local neighbours are a massive
OL,10,Fpenguin colony, so that will be
OL,11,Ffantastic," the Royal Air Force veteran
OL,12,Fsaid.
